    15["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Reservations System (legacy)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Software System]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Existing system: non-pool<br />reservations, prices, stay<br />settlement and refunds at<br />checkout, cancellations,<br />manager reports. No API, only<br />file exchange. Blocks a room<br />pool that only we sell.</div>"]
